# f1 = count, f2 = weigh, f3 = turn . L0 = Span
# `span: Span | string` and the body asks `typeof span === "string"`: so the guard's test was widened to string|L0. But what is PROVEN to arrive is undefined|i32|L0: every number failed the
# widened guard too and took the whole function written straight (137,949 instructions a round of a hundred calls against 6,632). A guard that the body widens stays only where the widened test
